commit 29dea1d1f8b4da34e6d4f227fab1583ddf1361cf
Author:     Will Deacon <will.deacon@arm.com>
AuthorDate: Tue Jun 9 18:23:45 2015 +0100
Commit:     Will Deacon <will.deacon@arm.com>
CommitDate: Tue Jun 9 18:51:31 2015 +0100

    locking/qrwlock: remove redundant barriers on writer slow-path
    =

    When transitioning from unlocked - locked (for write), we notify readers
    of our presence by setting the _QW_WAITING flag using a cmpxchg.
    =

    Given that we use another cmpxchg to transition to the _QW_LOCKED state,
    we can drop the barriers from the intermediate step.
    =

    Signed-off-by: Will Deacon <will.deacon@arm.com>

